            <ArticleTitle>A Cascade Dehydrogenative Cross-Coupling/Annulation Reaction of Benzamides with β-Keto Esters for the Synthesis of Isoquinolinone Derivatives.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>6265-6267</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/acs.orglett.7b02978</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A novel cascade DCC/annulation reaction of N-alkoxybenzamides with β-keto esters has been developed for the synthesis of isoquinolinone derivatives under palladium catalysis. A plausible mechanism involving α-C(sp2)-H activation and a Pd(II)/Pd(IV) catalytic cycle is also proposed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
